===Celadon Gym===
[[File:Celadon Gym FRLG.png|thumb|Celadon Gym]]

{{sign|FRLG|header}}
{{sign|FRLG|title|CELADON CITY POKéMON GYM<br>LEADER: ERIKA}}
{{sign|FRLG|The Nature Loving Princess!}}
